        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG3005D, Stainless Steel Rectangular Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bogota Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset is made out of 304 grade stainless steel and is available in either satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel finish colors. Choose from a wide selection of stainless steel interior trim levers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/bogota-stainless-steel-mortise-handleset-ahi-sig3005\"><b>AHI SIG3005 Stainless Steel Entry Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>All Stainless Steel Trim:</b> From <a href=\"/collections/ahi\"><b>AHI Hardware</b></a> the SIG3005D is made from 304 grade stainless steel, which is resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications: AHI SIG3004D Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 17-1/4\" (438 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/4\" (70 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\" (279 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/4\" (70 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG3005.pdf?v=1691093349\"><b>AHI SIG3005D Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>*** Item Discontinued: See available <a href=\"/collections/ahi\"><b>AHI Stainless Steel Hardware</b></a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
